//? Title: Viterbi: actual maximum-path tables and backtracking
//? Subtitle: Actual native state and retained original experiments
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
An observed symbol stream can be compatible with many hidden state sequences.
Viterbi finds the single path with greatest joint model probability, retaining
the predecessors needed to reconstruct it.
)

\toc

> The method

Initialize delta_0(i)=log pi_i+log B(i,o_0). Then
delta_t(j)=max_i[delta_(t−1)(i)+log A(i,j)]+log B(j,o_t), recording the actual
maximizing predecessor. The best prefix to state j must extend a best prefix to
some predecessor, proving optimal substructure. Backtrack from the final
maximizing state. This maximizes joint path probability, not each smoothed
marginal independently; P(path|observations) shares the same maximizer because
the evidence normalizer is common. Work is(T−1)N² predecessor candidates, with
O(TN) retained tables. Zero weights give −infinity; impossible evidence has no
decoded path.

> Simple worked example

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/viterbi_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto h = a::forward_backward_example_model();
    auto r = a::viterbi_work(h, {0, 1, 2});
    std::print("| day index | actual delta | actual predecessors |\n|---:|---|---|\n");
    for (std::size_t t = 0; t < r.delta.size(); ++t)
        std::print("|{}|`{}`|`{}`|\n", t, r.delta[t], r.predecessor[t]);
    std::print("\nActual path `{}`, joint log mass {}.\n", r.result.states,
               r.result.log_probability);
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0}, "Symbols normal,cold,dizzy");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0},
                         std::format("{} actual predecessor candidates",
                                     r.transition_terms));
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0},
                         std::format("Actual best path {}", r.result.states));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/viterbi_tiny.svg");
}
```
